ub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.beta.custom_build [b15b24b08] and previous\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia 15.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen building the Godot editor for macOS without an .app bundle, the modification/creation date is correct. However, when it is built with the `generate_bundle=yes` argument, the resulting bundle has a \"Date Created\" and \"Date Modified\" value of March 14, 2024 at 9:00 PM PT. This makes it difficult to tell at a glance which bundled builds of Godot are newer than others.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10d7b0dc-1d0e-401c-9230-d4c162e70029)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild Godot on macOS without generating a bundle:\n```\nscons generate_bundle=no\n```\nThe resulting executable will have the correct \"Date Created\" and \"Date Modified\" information.\n\nNext, build it and generate a bundle:\n```\nscons generate_bundle=yes\n```\nThe .app bundle will have a \"Date Created\" and \"Date Modified\" value of March 14, 2024 at 9:00 PM PT (I gather the exact time/date will differ based on your timezone).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","rep